1
00:00:12,192 --> 00:00:15,428
Comment tu as rencontré Léa ?
How did you meet Léa?

2
00:00:15,528 --> 00:00:20,084
Il pleuvait ce jour-là et je n'avais pas de parapluie.
It was raining that day and I didn't have an umbrella.

3
00:00:20,184 --> 00:00:22,556
Et alors ?
And then?

4
00:00:22,656 --> 00:00:27,788
J'attendais le bus quand une fille m'a proposé son parapluie.
I was waiting for the bus when a girl offered me her umbrella.

5
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:30,284
C'était Léa ?
Was it Léa?

6
00:00:30,384 --> 00:00:38,804
Oui ! Nous avons parlé jusqu'à l'arrivée du bus. Depuis, nous sommes amies.
Yes! We talked until the bus arrived. Since then, we've been friends.
